WEBVTT

00:02.760 --> 00:05.500
Then do not blame your elder brother for showing no mercy!

00:05.840 --> 00:11.500
Though Father may despise me and history books may revile my name,

00:11.880 --> 00:18.000
our father was cursed with few heirs—there are only the two of us! Once you are gone, who else could he possibly pass the realm to?!
